# APatch boot test: disable ThinLTO on the APatch branches.
# Stock kernel (clang r536225, LTO on, CFI on) boots with APatch, but our
# r536225 + LTO-on build still hangs at the first screen. LTO changes code
# generation and symbol layout, which can break KernelPatch's runtime
# symbol resolution. If this build boots, LTO was the blocker.
# CONFIG_LTO_CLANG is the ThinLTO toggle in kernel 4.14.
# CONFIG_LTO_CLANG is not set
